    <!-- Core API / Optional API split mirrors AQ_XLL's src\Core / src\Optional file
         organisation (CLAUDE.md Sec 4.4/6.3): Core = always-needed infrastructure a
         product depends on regardless of edition; Optional = one folder per product
         category. Repeated under both "include" and "src" so headers and source files
         land in the same category tree, browsable the same way AQ_XLL's category file
         names are. -->
